ion between `toKey` and `cellKey.split(\",\")`. The coordinate is now carried alongside the count instead of being re-parsed out of the string key.\n- **Rule 4 (Fewest Elements):** Eliminated the string-to-number reconstruction step (`split`/`map(Number)`), reducing invocations and a redundant destructuring.\n- **Naming:** `nextGeneration`, `toKey`, `NEIGHBOR_OFFSETS` all still fit; renamed `liveNeighborCounts` → `neighborCounts` since it now holds `{cell, count}` records, not raw counts.\n\n**Benefits:** Clearer expression of the game rules, no fragile key-parsing, lower complexity mass (43 → 22 in the hot block).\n\n### Step 7: Report\n\n**Refactoring Complete:**\n- **Refactoring:** Extracted named rule predicate `survivesOrIsBorn`; stored coordinates with counts to remove the `split`/`map(Number)` round-trip and its conceptual duplication with `toKey`.\n- **Mass Change:** target loop block 43 → 22 (Δ −21)\n- **Tests:** All 8 passing."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":4557,"output":853,"cacheRead":10613,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":16023,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784959687633,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-cf3b9bb1-4cf4-4dd4-92ec-513d8289a8d2","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"}],"stderr":"","usage":{"input":13665,"output":4210,"cacheRead":52551,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"contextTokens":16023,"turns":5},"model":"requesty/vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","stopReason":"stop"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1784959698955},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_0187hR6reULwt1bBzJn5GU9H","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_06-03-04_game-of-life-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_opus-4-8 && pnpm test 2>&1 | grep \"Tests\" && echo \"---\" && cat src/game-of-life.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claud